          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musa yaija, we na Yoshua mwene Nuuni baagamba ebigambo byona eby'ekyo kyeshongoro, abantu babihuriire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.32.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.32.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 32:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musa ku yaaherize kugambira Abaisraeli boona ebyo bigambo byona, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.32.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.32.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 32:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "yaabagira ati: Mute emitima yaanyu aha bigambo byona, ebi naabeehanangiriza eri izooba, mubiragiire abaana baanyu, babone kworobera ebigambo byona eby'ebi biragiro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.32.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.32.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 32:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahakuba okubyorobera ti ky'okufa busha, kureka nigo magara gaanyu, kandi nikyo kiribahaisa okuhangaarira omu nsi ei murikwambuka Yorudani kuza kukubuura.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.32.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.32.47"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 32:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.32.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.32.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 32:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahari eryo izooba MUKAMA yaagira Musa ati: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.32.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.32.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 32:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Temba oru rushozi Neebo ya Abariimu orw'omu nsi ya Moabu, orushungaine na Yeriko, oreebe ensi ya Kanaani, ei ndikuha Abaisraeli kuba eyaabo; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.32.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.32.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 32:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ofeere ahari orwo rushozi oru waaza kutemba, oshangye abaanyu, nk'oku Arooni mukuru waawe yaafeereire aha rushozi Hoori, akashanga abaabo; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.32.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.32.50"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 32:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "NUM.20.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kub 20:11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ahabw'okuba mukancumuraho omu maisho g'Abaisraeli, muri aha maizi ga Meriba ahari Kadeshi omu ihamba rya Ziini; kandi timwampaisa kitiinisa omu Baisraeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.32.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.32.51"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "52",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 32:52"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Noija kureeba egyo nsi ei ndikuha Abaisraeli omu maisho gaawe, kwonka torigihikamu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.32.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.32.52"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
